    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d258">

                <pb facs="0402" n="286" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg286"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 839.00/1704.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-05-14T11:00:00-04:40">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 14, 1915—11 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Horacista Bonneti shot and killed General Ricart, chief of the President’s
                    bodyguard, yesterday afternoon. As a result, political feeling runs high.
                    Bonneti is cousin of Tejera who, with Vidal, shot Cáceres.<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d258-f1"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sullivan.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
